blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.4-stable\n\n### System information\n\nUbuntu 20.04\n\n### Issue description\n\nAt line 1225 in the file /godot/servers/audio_server.cpp, a pointer variable named playback_node is defined and allocated a new dynamic memory region using the new operator. When the if condition at line 1232 evaluates to true, the function neither utilizes the dynamic memory region pointed to by playback_node as done at line 1259 nor frees the dynamic memory region pointed to by new_bus_details (another dynamically allocated memory block) before returning, as done at line 1233. This results in a memory leak defect, as illustrated below.\nhttps://github.com/LuMingYinDetect/godot_defects/blob/main/godot_2.png\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nIt can be triggered by following the path.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nIt can be triggered by following the path.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103882/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":